---
const urlEs = "/sobre-el-proyecto";
const urlEn = "/en/about";
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>About the Project | SelfHostDeck</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      background-color: #0f172a;
      color: #e2e8f0;
      min-height: 100dvh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: 10vh auto auto auto;
    }

    .top-nav {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .btn-volver {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.4rem;
      color: #38bdf8;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .btn-volver:hover {
      color: #7dd3fc;
      text-decoration: underline;
      transform: translateX(-3px);
    }

    .lang-switch {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      background: #131d31;
      border: 1px solid #334155;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
      gap: 0.35rem;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .lang-switch a {
      color: #94a3b8;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .lang-switch a:hover {
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .lang-switch a.active {
      background: #0284c7;
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .lang-divider {
      color: #334155;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      user-select: none;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2.25rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #ffffff;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    }

    .sub {
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .box {
      background: #1e293b;
      border: 1px solid #334155;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }

    .box h2 {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #ffffff;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .box p {
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .tech-stack {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      margin-top: 0.75rem;
    }

    .tech-tag {
      background: #0f172a;
      border: 1px solid #334155;
      color: #38bdf8;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 0.65rem 1.25rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: background-color 0.2s;
    }

    .btn-linkedin {
      background: #0a66c2;
    }

    .btn-linkedin:hover {
      background: #004182;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <main class="container">
    <div class="top-nav">
      <a href="/en" class="btn-volver" id="btnVolver">
        ← Back to catalog
      </a>

      <div class="lang-switch">
        <a href={urlEs}>ES</a>
        <span class="lang-divider">/</span>
        <a href={urlEn} class="active">EN</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h1>About the Project</h1>
    <p class="sub">Mission, technical architecture, and digital sovereignty behind the catalog.</p>

    <div class="box">
      <h2>What is SelfHostDeck?</h2>
      <p>SelfHostDeck is a curated, automated directory designed to help developers and homelabbers discover open-source, self-hosted alternatives to proprietary commercial SaaS tools.</p>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">The mission is to empower digital sovereignty, reduce recurring subscription costs, and give users complete ownership over their infrastructure and data.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="box">
      <h2>How it Works</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">The platform indexes technical data in real time from official GitHub repositories, evaluates use cases with local AI models to map them against direct commercial alternatives, and generates production-ready Docker Compose configurations.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="box">
      <h2>Architecture & Tech Stack</h2>
      <p>Engineered with modern tools focused on speed, accessibility, and static rendering:</p>
      <div class="tech-stack">
        <span class="tech-tag">Astro</span>
        <span class="tech-tag">TypeScript</span>
        <span class="tech-tag">Supabase (PostgreSQL)</span>
        <span class="tech-tag">Python Pipeline</span>
        <span class="tech-tag">Docker</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="box">
      <h2>Project Creator</h2>
      <p>Developed and maintained as an open initiative to support data ownership and the self-hosted ecosystem.</p>
      <a 
        href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/denis-campayo-dev" 
        target="_blank" 
        rel="noopener noreferrer" 
        class="btn btn-linkedin"
      >
        View LinkedIn profile &rarr;
      </a>
    </div>
  </main>
<script is:inline>
    const btnVolver = document.getElementById('btnVolver');
    const paginaGuardada = sessionStorage.getItem('ultimaPaginaCatalogo');
    if (btnVolver && paginaGuardada && paginaGuardada !== '1') {
      btnVolver.href = `/en/${paginaGuardada}`;
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>